# AOZ Wohnen — host, database, languages

## Database

Live instance: https://aoz.orangecat.ch on Hetzner `bitbaum`. App `/opt/aoz-wohnen/`. Database **`aoz_wohnen`** on that box's Postgres (`127.0.0.1:5432`). Env SSOT: `/opt/aoz-wohnen/shared/.env`.

Neon is not the database. A laptop `.env` naming `neon.tech` is stale. Read `docs/INFRASTRUCTURE.md` before Prisma. Deploy is push to `master` (`.github/workflows/deploy.yml`); that job runs `prisma migrate deploy`. Uncommitted work is not live.

## Languages

`src/lib/i18n/` is the **resident portal**. Staff UI stays German (caseworkers speak state languages + English). Do not put Tigrinya, Arabic, Farsi, etc. on `(admin)`. `LanguageSwitcher` / `LocaleProvider` stay under `src/app/portal/`.
